sequenceDiagram
    %% ExchangeUseCase
    %% WalletService, WalletBalanceService
    %% ExchangeRateQueryService
    %% LedgerRepository

    participant C as Client
    participant UC as ExchangeUseCase
    participant WS as WalletService
    %% participant WBS as WalletBalanceService
    participant ERQ as ExchangeRateQueryService
    participant LR as LedgerRepository

    %% start
    C ->> UC: exchange(walletId, base, target, amount)
    Note over UC: BEGIN TX

    %% 의도적으로 간략하게 기술함
    UC ->> WS: 지갑 및 잔액 조회
    WS -->> UC: Wallet + Balances 반환

    %% 의도적으로 간략하게 기술
    UC ->> ERQ: 최신 환율 조회
    ERQ -->> UC: 최신 환율 반환

    %% 중요
    UC ->> UC: 환전 금액 계산

    UC ->> WS: 잔액 변경
    Note over WS: Base 통화 잔액 차감 + Target 통화 잔액 증가

    UC ->> LR : 환전 원장 기록 (2건)

    alt success
        Note over UC: COMMIT
        UC -->> C: ExchangeResult
    else failure
        Note over UC: ROLLBACK
        UC -->> C: error
    end





